{"id":3167260,"shortDescription":"Las ratas me obligaron a crear este juego. Corre y dispara junto a tus tropas en la Gran Guerra de las Ratas contra los viles ejércitos de TecnoRatas. Recluta unidades, construye estructuras, consigue equipo y mejora tus armas para cambiar el rumbo de la batalla. ¡La TecnoRata lo consume todo!","developers":["wootusart Industries"],"publishers":["wootusart Industries"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Comodidad de la cámara","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Compat. parcial con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"20 NOV 2025","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795301509","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/ss_d01698cd76f37a2af293a76b5150e1e58cd6ac11.600x338.jpg?t=1795301509","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/ss_d01698cd76f37a2af293a76b5150e1e58cd6ac11.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795301509"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/090ece8886b53addc99b75e32984f70ebe592d27/ss_090ece8886b53addc99b75e32984f70ebe592d27.600x338.jpg?t=1795301509","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/090ece8886b53addc99b75e32984f70ebe592d27/ss_090ece8886b53addc99b75e32984f70ebe592d27.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795301509"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/eef4c6c44853d17e04bc10d98c9cb8877ca6a32d/ss_eef4c6c44853d17e04bc10d98c9cb8877ca6a32d.600x338.jpg?t=1795301509","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/eef4c6c44853d17e04bc10d98c9cb8877ca6a32d/ss_eef4c6c44853d17e04bc10d98c9cb8877ca6a32d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795301509"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167260/eb09e4f8ec78b6d